# Task 4 report — Memory reverse timeline, category selection, and Korean labels

## Scope

Changed only the Task 4 files:

- `src/pages/MemoryPage.tsx`
- `src/pages/MemoryPage.module.css`
- `src/App.test.tsx`

## Implementation

- Replaced the Memory lens labels with the exact Korean labels `시간 흐름`, `기억 관계`, and `사용자 설명`; the existing half-life, constellation, and manual routes are unchanged.
- Removed the duplicated top-level Memory introduction and the `MEMORY LENS` / `MEMORY HALF-LIFE` labels.
- Added `selectedCategory: MemoryCategory`, defaulting to `코딩`, and four category buttons: `코딩`, `일`, `취향`, `개인`.
- Rendered exactly one memory row for the selected category while retaining the existing pin callback and pressed-state behavior.
- Reversed the timeline buckets to `archive`, `1y`, `90d`, `30d`, `now` and labeled them `보관 예정`, `1년 전`, `90일 전`, `30일 전`, `최근`.
- Reduced the old multi-row empty area and compacted the controls for the 1280×720 presentation viewport.

## TDD evidence

1. Added an App integration test for the default coding view, preference selection, and reverse time-header order; updated the existing pin test to select `일` first.
2. Ran the focused App test before implementation: 2 failures, both due to the missing category buttons (`일` and `코딩`).
3. Implemented the smallest state, rendering, and labeling changes needed for the assertions.
4. Re-ran the focused App test after implementation: 16/16 pass.

## Verification

- `npm test -- src/App.test.tsx` — 16/16 tests pass.
- `npm run lint` — exits successfully with no findings.
- `npm run build` — TypeScript and Vite production build exit successfully.
- `npx playwright test -g "desktop minimum viewport"` — passes; no horizontal or vertical overflow at 1280×720.
- Visual inspection of `test-results/visual/half-life-1280x720.png` confirms the older-to-newer header sequence and compact single-row layout.
- `git diff --check` — no whitespace errors for tracked changes.

## Self-review

- The default view renders only `코딩`; choosing `취향` removes coding cards and renders preference cards.
- The leftmost header is `보관 예정` and the rightmost header is `최근`.
- Pin clicks still call `setPinned` and update `aria-pressed`.
- The constellation and manual component branches and their route paths are unchanged.

## Concern

`e2e/memory-os.spec.ts` has an older full-demo assertion that clicks the `일` memory pin immediately on the default Memory view. It must select the `일` category first under the new required default-only `코딩` behavior. It was intentionally left untouched because Task 4 scope permits only the Memory files and `src/App.test.tsx`.


